@startuml
title US-003 - Activate member account - SD level 2
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 75
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF2F8
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #FEF9E7
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
autonumber

actor "Invited Person" as Person
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "Nexo API" as API

note over UI, API
  Password flow only. OAuth endpoints and session delivery\nafter activation are not yet specified.
end note
Person -> UI: Activate account (email, name, password)
activate UI
UI -> API: POST /accounts/activation (ActivateAccountDto)
activate API
alt Request accepted
    API --> UI: 200 OK (AccountDto)
else Invalid required details
    API --> UI: 400 Bad Request
else No account registered for email
    API --> UI: 403 Forbidden
else Account already Active
    API --> UI: 409 Conflict
else Persistence failure
    API --> UI: 500 Internal Server Error
end
deactivate API
alt Successful response
    UI --> Person: Existing account activated (Active)
else Error response
    UI --> Person: Show validation, authorization, or operation error
end
deactivate UI
@enduml
